    "summary": "Only ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY models can take this. Whenever an INFANTRY or MOUNTED enemy unit finishes a Fall Back, Charge, Advance or Normal move no more than 8\" from the bearer's unit, you roll a D6; on a 4+ that enemy unit becomes stunned until your next turn starts. While stunned, its models subtract 1 from their Hit rolls.",
